# Code owners (architecture issue 0028). GitHub requests a review from the owner of every path a
# pull request touches; the last matching line wins, so more specific paths come later.
#
# @gtech-mulearn/team is the team that maintains this repository. The paths below that need two
# reviewers (core-review: authz, messaging, contributions, identity_access, workflows) are also
# enforced by .github/workflows/two-reviewers.yml (issue 0029). Split an entry to a narrower team
# once that team exists and has write access here: an owner without write access is ignored.

# Shared building blocks
/building_blocks/                  @gtech-mulearn/team
/building_blocks/authz/            @gtech-mulearn/team
/building_blocks/messaging/        @gtech-mulearn/team

# Modules whose changes need two reviewers
/modules/contributions/            @gtech-mulearn/team
/modules/identity_access/          @gtech-mulearn/team

# The architecture, CI and the vendored schema
/docs/architecture/                @gtech-mulearn/team
/.github/workflows/                @gtech-mulearn/team
/schema/                           @gtech-mulearn/team
